 "metrics": {
  "B equals O": "B gives the oracle's values, bit for bit, refusal codes, labels and notes on every frame of every pair",
  "M1": "B equals A1 on every output both write, sign of zero included; on the edge set B equals O",
  "M10": "FACS -> FB2: B equals A3 on outputs both write; coverage list frozen; B refuses 0 frames",
  "M10b": "FACS -> ARKit: B equals A3 then A1 on outputs both write; coverage list frozen",
  "M11": "report: per ICT-FaceKit FACS row, B ARKit -> FACS links give the same ARKit shapes, or a listed difference",
  "M1s": "exact Fraction composition of B equals A1 on every linear A1 output",
  "M2": "in every frame B's refused outputs are among A1's, B writes every output A1 writes, dropped inputs equal",
  "M2c": "for every A1 output, B's hop evidence holds every evidence ID of the A1 rules that write it",
  "M3 coverage": "on every impulse frame B changes exactly the outputs O changes; every composed link is changed or on the frozen flat list; every reached output non-zero on at least 1% of each seeded family that sets a linked input",
  "M3 exact": "round trips exact on the listed channels; the rounding outputs within 2**-54 on exclusive frames and each gaze output within min(a, b) + 2**-52 on frames that break FB2 exclusivity",
  "M4": "B observed loss 0; A1 observed loss equals the registered baseline",
  "M4 keys": "every (A1 rule, A1 loss reason) of the frozen table is covered by the B losses it names on the route; every audit key B adds on an A1 pair is on the audit-added list",
  "M4b": "every catalogue entry of each replaced A1 rule is held by the hop assumption keys it names on the route, or is superseded with a cited reason",
  "M5 R1": "R1: 129 of 129 goldens exact through B",
  "M5 R2": "R2: per ARKit target, the composed B weights equal the 52 source-derived rows but the listed departures",
  "M6": "report: B and A1 (A3 then A1 for FACS) pose each rig identically, vertex for vertex; the harness oracles pass",
  "M7": "every registered mutation of the B pack is caught by each check it names",
  "M8 R3": "report: FB2 -> VRCFT UE, B equals R3 (the Godot route) on every R3 output but the listed departures"
 },
